<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (To address these challenges, TaxPal was developed as a secure and user-friendly full-stack personal finance platform designed especially for freelancers and self-employed individuals. It provides a centralized system for managing different aspects of personal and professional finances. Users can record and categorize their income and expenses, monitor their spending patterns, and manage monthly budgets effectively. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
286 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (A major feature of TaxPal is its quarterly tax estimation system, which calculates estimated national and state taxes based on factors such as country, location, filing status, income, deductions, and applicable tax slab structures. This helps users understand their potential tax liability and plan their finances accordingly. The platform also provides automated reminders for important financial activities and tax deadlines, reducing the chances of missing critical payments. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
