/E (Integration Testing: The integration between the Angular frontend and Express.js backend was carefully tested. Audited local builds to identify inconsistencies between Angular service fields and Express controller parameters. Mismatched keys such as incomeBracket and income_bracket were identified and synchronized to ensure smooth data exchange. )
