/K [7]
>>
endobj
792 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/E (Data Scoping Verification: Security tests were performed to ensure that users could access only their own financial records. For example, requests were simulated where User B attempted to retrieve or modify transactions belonging to User A. The backend correctly rejected unauthorized requests by returning appropriate responses such as 404 Not Found or 401 Unauthorized. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
